---
import NerdBox from "@/components/caira/NerdBox.astro";
---

<section class="sec reveal" id="s10">
  <p class="eyebrow">
    <span class="secnum">10</span>&nbsp;Concepts 6 and 7 · fallback and queues
  </p>
  <h2>The product must outlive the vendor</h2>
  <div class="plain">
    <span class="lbl">In plain English</span>
    <p>
      Some day Gemini will have a bad minute. In most products the AI feature
      just dies. Caira downgrades to a simple keyword matcher and keeps
      answering: simpler replies, zero cost, nobody left on read.
    </p>
    <p class="analogy">
      If the head chef is sick, the restaurant does not close. The sous-chef
      cooks a simpler menu.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="play">
    <div class="play-label">▶ Playground: break the AI</div>
    <label style="display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:center;font-size:.92rem">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gemini-up" checked /> 💚 Primary model is healthy
      (untick to unleash chaos)
    </label>
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 440 190"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Router diagram: an incoming message reaches a router, which sends it to Gemini 2.5 while the primary model is healthy, or to a keyword bot fallback the moment it is not"
    >
      <defs>
        <marker
          id="r-ar"
          markerWidth="9"
          markerHeight="9"
          refX="7"
          refY="4"
          orient="auto"
        >
          <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" fill="#34E4CE"></path></marker
        >
        <marker
          id="r-arA"
          markerWidth="9"
          markerHeight="9"
          refX="7"
          refY="4"
          orient="auto"
        >
          <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" fill="#F5B54A"></path></marker
        >
        <style is:inline>
          .rbx {
            fill: #141c26;
            stroke: #2c3a49;
            stroke-width: 1;
          }
          .rbxP {
            fill: #141c26;
            stroke: #34e4ce;
            stroke-width: 1.6;
          }
          .rbxF {
            fill: #141c26;
            stroke: #f5b54a;
            stroke-width: 1.6;
          }
          .rt {
            font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            fill: #dce5ee;
          }
          .rs {
            font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
            font-size: 9px;
            fill: #8b99a8;
          }
          .rl {
            stroke: #4a5a6b;
            stroke-width: 1.6;
            fill: none;
          }
          .rlP {
            stroke: #34e4ce;
            stroke-width: 2;
            fill: none;
            marker-end: url(#r-ar);
          }
          .rlF {
            stroke: #f5b54a;
            stroke-width: 2;
            fill: none;
            marker-end: url(#r-arA);
          }
        </style>
      </defs>

      <rect class="rbx" x="10" y="70" width="90" height="50" rx="10"></rect>
      <text class="rt" x="55" y="99" text-anchor="middle">message</text>

      <rect class="rbx" x="160" y="70" width="100" height="50" rx="10"></rect>
      <text class="rt" x="210" y="92" text-anchor="middle">ROUTER</text>
      <text class="rs" x="210" y="107" text-anchor="middle">fallback-llm</text>

      <line class="rl flow-dash" x1="100" y1="95" x2="155" y2="95"></line>

      <g id="path-primary">
        <line class="rlP flow-dash" x1="260" y1="85" x2="330" y2="45"></line>
        <rect class="rbxP" x="335" y="20" width="95" height="46" rx="10"></rect>
        <text class="rt" x="382" y="40" text-anchor="middle" fill="#34E4CE"
          >Gemini 2.5</text
        >
        <text class="rs" x="382" y="55" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8FE8DB"
          >smart · costs money</text
        >
      </g>

      <g id="path-fallback" style="opacity:.18">
        <line class="rlF flow-dash" x1="260" y1="105" x2="330" y2="145"></line>
        <rect class="rbxF" x="335" y="124" width="95" height="46" rx="10"
        ></rect>
        <text class="rt" x="382" y="144" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F5B54A"
          >Keyword bot</text
        >
        <text class="rs" x="382" y="159" text-anchor="middle" fill="#E8CFA0"
          >simple · free · alive</text
        >
      </g>
    </svg>
    <p id="router-msg" style="font-size:.92rem;font-weight:600"></p>
  </div>
  <div class="plain">
    <span class="lbl">And the letterbox</span>
    <p>
      A phone call needs both people free at the same moment. A letter does not:
      drop it in the box, get your receipt instantly, the postman delivers when
      ready and retries if you are not home. Slow work goes through the
      letterbox so WhatsApp never waits on a slow model.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="fig">
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 460 160"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Queue diagram: a webhook replies instantly and hands the message to a queue with four pulsing dots, a worker then drains the queue and does the slow work safely"
    >
      <defs>
        <marker
          id="q-ar"
          markerWidth="9"
          markerHeight="9"
          refX="7"
          refY="4"
          orient="auto"
        >
          <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" fill="#34E4CE"></path></marker
        >
        <style is:inline>
          .qbx {
            fill: #141c26;
            stroke: #2c3a49;
            stroke-width: 1;
          }
          .qq {
            fill: #141c26;
            stroke: #34e4ce;
            stroke-width: 1.6;
          }
          .qt {
            font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            fill: #dce5ee;
          }
          .qs {
            font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
            font-size: 9px;
            fill: #8b99a8;
          }
          .ql {
            stroke: #4a5a6b;
            stroke-width: 1.6;
            fill: none;
            marker-end: url(#q-ar);
          }
          .qdot {
            fill: #34e4ce;
          }
        </style>
      </defs>

      <rect class="qbx" x="10" y="55" width="95" height="50" rx="10"></rect>
      <text class="qt" x="57" y="77" text-anchor="middle">webhook</text>
      <text class="qs" x="57" y="92" text-anchor="middle">"got it" in 50ms</text
      >

      <line class="ql flow-dash" x1="105" y1="80" x2="160" y2="80"></line>

      <rect class="qq" x="165" y="50" width="130" height="60" rx="10"></rect>
      <text class="qt" x="230" y="72" text-anchor="middle" fill="#34E4CE"
        >QUEUE 📬</text
      >
      <circle class="qdot pulse" cx="195" cy="92" r="6"></circle>
      <circle
        class="qdot pulse"
        cx="218"
        cy="92"
        r="6"
        style="animation-delay:.3s"></circle>
      <circle
        class="qdot pulse"
        cx="241"
        cy="92"
        r="6"
        style="animation-delay:.6s"></circle>
      <circle
        class="qdot pulse"
        cx="264"
        cy="92"
        r="6"
        style="animation-delay:.9s"></circle>

      <line class="ql flow-dash" x1="295" y1="80" x2="350" y2="80"></line>

      <rect class="qbx" x="355" y="55" width="95" height="50" rx="10"></rect>
      <text class="qt" x="402" y="77" text-anchor="middle">worker</text>
      <text class="qs" x="402" y="92" text-anchor="middle">retried safely</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="play">
    <div class="play-label">▶ Playground: the model has a 25 second day</div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <button class="btn" data-queue-mode="phone">📞 Phone-call mode</button>
      <button class="btn primary" data-queue-mode="queue"
        >📬 Letterbox mode</button
      >
    </div>
    <div class="playlog" id="queue-log">…</div>
  </div>
  <NerdBox>
    fallback is a decorator on the LlmProvider port (429/timeout → keyword
    matcher); jobs are Postgres rows drained by cron with SKIP LOCKED, claim
    100, dead-letter after 5 attempts; message-id idempotency makes Meta retries
    harmless
  </NerdBox>
</section>
